{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06624","headline":"贻余处士 · 储光羲","name":"贻余处士","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"故园至新浦，遥复未百里。\n北望是他邦，纷吾即游士。\n潮来津门啓，罢楫信流水。\n客意乃成欢，舟人亦相喜。\n迟迟菱荇上，泛泛孤蒲里。\n渐闻商旅喧，犹见凫鷖起。\n市亭忽云构，方物如山峙。\n吴王昔丧元，隋帝又灭祀。\n停舻一以眺，太息兴亡理。\n秋苑故池田，宫门新柳杞。\n我行苦炎月，乃及清昊始。\n此地日逢迎，终思隐君子。\n莫言异舒卷，形音在心耳。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"储光羲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06624.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06624","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}